        "official_en_sha256": "eb4d7f0804bd12d6d7e7243bf482f6735bd07379962425f0bd254173a496c6cc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "まさか時空を越えてラピスにきていたなんて……。\r\n下手をしたらこの世界が滅ぼされていたかもよ。",
        "official_en": "Somehow, across time and space, it made its way to Lapis... And if we hadn’t stopped it, this world might have been done for.",
        "real_en": "I can't believe it crossed time and space to reach Lapis...\nIf things had gone badly, this world might have been destroyed."
